<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
    Status-bar icon for the playback notification.

    Must be a flat, fully-opaque white glyph on transparency: the system
    ignores color entirely and builds the status-bar icon from the alpha
    channel alone. ic_launcher_foreground (the previous smallIcon) is an
    adaptive-icon layer with a semi-transparent gradient across the whole
    108dp canvas, which the alpha-only rendering turns into a blurry blob —
    permanently visible, since this is an ongoing foreground-service
    notification.
-->
